1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,162
Mwah-ha-ha-ha!

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:06,520
Two hungry villains, Bad Billy and Big Pea, were busy searching for some afternoon tea.

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,690
It was worms they were after, and Bad Billy led the way.

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:14,880
But after a good look around, they both realised there were no worms to be found.

5
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,030
You are very annoying.

6
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:21,003
Why are you still here?

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,490
Then, very... very... slowly... someone else arrived.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,321
Go on! Shoo, you silly birds!

9
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,409
Ah, these birds are big trouble makers, mun.
